<title>ZAIRE: SOCCER-ZAIRE AND CONGO DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAIRE AND CONGO DRAW 1-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire and Congo drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a World Cup African zone, group three</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Congo - Chris Mbongo 3</p>
<p>Zaire - Lembi Nzelo 13</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
</text>
